  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。滿懷熱情製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">GUI Effect Timer 是一個用戶端模組，可在螢幕上的效果圖示底部增加計時器。它支援秒、分鐘、小時和天的縮寫顯示。每刻更新，讓你能準確看到效果何時結束。當你身處岩漿中且帶有抗火效果時，這項功能非常實用！<br><br>文字顏色可在設定檔中輕鬆更改。預設為白色。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：用戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>timerColourRGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">計時器文字的紅色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>timerColourRGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">計時器文字的綠色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>timerColourRGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 255，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">計時器文字的藍色 RGB 值。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-effect-timer/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於指令設定的無限數值：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-effect-timer/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>文字顏色可以設定！這是金色——RGB: 255, 215, 0</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-effect-timer/c.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤留言。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
